# Generated files that are committed must come back byte for byte when they are regenerated.
# Their generators write LF line endings, so git must check them out with LF on every machine,
# whatever core.autocrlf says. Without this, Git for Windows checks docs/eda.md out with CRLF,
# and regenerating it shows the file as modified although its content is the same.
docs/eda.md text eol=lf
docs/features.md text eol=lf
docs/figures/*.png binary
